ShroudForge 1.7.8 is the latest stable release listed in the repository on 3 November 2026.

== Highlights ==

* Adds game profiles for Enshrouded Hotfix #4.
* Improves the loading of large mod manifests and Modloader responsiveness.
* Adds <code>shroudforge.clock()</code>.
* Improves automatic discovery of beta game profiles.
* Adds a runtime compatibility banner.

See the [https://github.com/bonsaibauer/shroudforge/releases/tag/v1.7.8-build.41706360752 full GitHub release notes] for the build number, downloads, and complete changes.

